GIMP Palette
Name: Pallid Keep - Spectre (ghostlight)
Columns: 4
# Hero decoration: corpse-candles, cold light in the arrow slits, the haze off a dead thing. Bone white with a lilac cast — NOT cyan, which now belongs to a portal twin. Pops by VALUE, not hue: spectre-4 is the brightest thing on the map, which is what makes a deep blue room feel haunted rather than merely dark.
